         aria-label=\"繁體中文\"\r\n                    alt=\"繁體中文\"\r\n                    title=\"繁體中文\"\r\n                  >\r\n                    繁\r\n                  </button>\r\n                  <ul\r\n                    id=\"lang_elem_list\"\r\n                    tabindex=\"-1\"\r\n                    role=\"listbox\"\r\n                    class=\"hidden\"\r\n                  >\r\n                    <li\r\n                      id=\"lang_tc\"\r\n                      onClick=\"changeLang('chi')\"\r\n                      onKeyPress=\"changeLang('chi')\"\r\n                      role=\"option\"\r\n                      aria-label=\"切換至繁體中文\"\r\n                    >\r\n                      繁\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li\r\n                      id=\"lang_en\"\r\n                      onClick=\"changeLang('eng')\"\r\n                      onKeyPress=\"changeLang('eng')\"\r\n                      role=\"option\"\r\n                      aria-label=\"切換至英文\"\r\n                    >\r\n                      ENG\r\n                    </li>\r\n                    <li\r\n                      id=\"lang_sc\"\r\n                      onClick=\"changeLang('schi')\"\r\n                      onKeyPress=\"changeLang('schi')\"\r\n                      role=\"option\"\r\n                      aria-label=\"切換至簡體中文\"\r\n                    >\r\n                      简\r\n                    </li>\r\n                  </ul>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n          <div class=\"green_bar\"></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div id=\"top_banner_area\" class=\"row collapse\">\r\n        <div class=\"large-12 columns\"></div>\r\n      </div>\r\n\r\n      <div id=\"main_content_area\">\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n          <div\r\n            class=\"large-12 columns text-center head-title\"\r\n            style=\"padding-top: 20px\"\r\n          >\r\n            <!-- <h1 style=\"margin-bottom: 15px;\"  ><b style=\"font-size: 35px; margin-left: 29px;\">恒生88週年優惠：</b></h1> -->\r\n            <h1>新資金定期存款優惠</h1>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n            <p class=\"textalign font\"></p>\r\n            <p>\r\n              透過網上理財 (包括恒生個人e-Banking<sup aria-hidden=\"true\">1</sup\r\n              ><span class=\"sr-only\">頁底備註[1]</span>及恒生Mobile App<sup\r\n                aria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n                >1</sup\r\n              ><span class=\"sr-only\">頁底備註[1]</span>)、電話理財<sup\r\n                aria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n                >2</sup\r\n              ><span class=\"sr-only\">頁底備註[2]</span\r\n              >或分行，於交易時段內以指定金額的「<strong>合資格新資金結餘</strong>」<sup\r\n                aria-hidden=\"true\"\r\n                >3</sup\r\n              ><span class=\"sr-only\">頁底備註[3]</span\r\n              >設立定期存款，可專享特優年利率。經網上理財設立定期存款更可享<strong>網上專屬優惠</strong>，簡單快捷！\r\n            </p>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"row xml-table\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n            <div class=\"tab-container\">\r\n              <div class=\"tab-btn-container\">\r\n                <div class=\"tab-btn-inner\">\r\n                  <div\r\n                    class=\"tab-btn\"\r\n                    data-target=\"signature\"\r\n                    id=\"prestige_private_rate_btn\"\r\n                    onclick=\"\r\n                      TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n                        event_value:\r\n                          'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_Prestige-Private-rate',\r\n                        event_category: 'content',\r\n                        event_action: 'button',\r\n                      })\r\n                    \"\r\n                  ></div>\r\n                  <div\r\n                    class=\"tab-btn\"\r\n        