\">\r\n                    <span>\r\n                      優越私人理財：<a\r\n                        href=\"tel:29988022\"\r\n                        id=\"prestige_private_call_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"\r\n                          TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n                            event_value:\r\n                              'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_Prestige-Private_call',\r\n                            event_category: 'content',\r\n                            event_action: 'button',\r\n                          })\r\n                        \"\r\n                        >2998 8022</a\r\n                      ></span\r\n                    >\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"tab-content\" data-target=\"prestige\">\r\n                <div class=\"tableWrappertwo tableWrappertwo_prestige\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"tableWrapper tableWrapper_prestige\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"remark word2 mt-0\">\r\n                  <div class=\"tncr\">\r\n                    上述年利率或會因應當時市場情況而有所更改。優惠乃根據本行於\r\n                    <span class=\"remark_date\"></span\r\n                    >公佈的年利率計算，僅供參考並須受有關<a\r\n                      class=\"exlink\"\r\n                      href=\"tnc.html?tab=prestige\"\r\n                      target=\"_blank\"\r\n                      style=\"color: #337ab7\"\r\n                      >條款及細則</a\r\n                    >約束。\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"tncr\"><b class=\"remarks_fromXML-green\"></b></div>\r\n                  <div class=\"hotline\">\r\n                    <span>\r\n                      優越理財：<a\r\n                        href=\"tel:29989188\"\r\n                        id=\"prestige_banking_call_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"\r\n                          TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n                            event_value:\r\n                              'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_Prestige-Banking_call',\r\n                            event_category: 'content',\r\n                            event_action: 'button',\r\n                          })\r\n                        \"\r\n                        >2998 9188</a\r\n                      ></span\r\n                    >\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"tab-content\" data-target=\"preferred\">\r\n                <div class=\"tableWrappertwo tableWrappertwo_preferred\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"tableWrapper tableWrapper_preferred\"></div>\r\n                <div class=\"remark word2 mt-0\">\r\n                  <div class=\"tncr\">\r\n                    上述年利率或會因應當時市場情況而有所更改。優惠乃根據本行於\r\n                    <span class=\"remark_date\"></span\r\n                    >公佈的年利率計算，僅供參考並須受有關<a\r\n                      class=\"exlink\"\r\n                      href=\"tnc.html?tab=preferred\"\r\n                      target=\"_blank\"\r\n                      style=\"color: #337ab7\"\r\n                      >條款及細則</a\r\n                    >約束。\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"tncr\"><b class=\"remarks_fromXML-green\"></b></div>\r\n                  <div class=\"hotline\">\r\n                    <span>\r\n                      優進理財：<a\r\n                        href=\"tel:28228228\"\r\n                        id=\"preferred_banking_call_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"\r\n                          TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n                            event_value:\r\n                              'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_Preferred-Banking_call',\r\n                            event_category: 'content',\r\n                            event_action: 'button',\r\n                          })\r\n                        \"\r\n                        >2822 8228</a\r\n                      >\r\n                      | 綜合戶口：<a\r\n                        href=\"tel:29988008\"\r\n                        id=\"preferred_banking_call_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"\r\n                          TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n                            event_value:\r\n                              'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_Preferred-Banking_call',\r\n                            event_category: 'content',\r\n                            event_action: 'button',\r\n                          })\r\n                        \"\r\n                        >2998 8008</a\r\n                      ></span\r\n                    >\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class=\"row\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\"></div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"row extra-offer\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n            <div class=\"card\">\r\n              <div class=\"head-title\">外幣兌換專享定期存款優惠<sup>4</sup></div>\r\n              <div class=\"flex-container\">\r\n                <img src=\"images/icon_save.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"img-icon\" />\r\n                <p>\r\n                  兌換指定外幣達港幣10,000或其等值<br />\r\n                  並同時設立一星期/一個月定存，可享專屬定存優惠！\r\n                </p>\r\n              </div>\r\n              <div class=\"link-container\">\r\n                <a\r\n                  class=\"exlink\"\r\n                  href=\"https://cms.hangseng.com/cms/emkt/pmo/grp03/p97/chi/index.html?view=p2g\"\r\n                  target=\"_blank\"\r\n                  id=\"fx_time_deposit_offer_learnmore_btn\"\r\n                  onclick=\"\r\n                    TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n                      event_value:\r\n                        'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_FX-time-deposit-offer_LearnMore',\r\n                      event_category: 'content',\r\n                      event_action: 'button',\r\n                    })\r\n                  \"\r\n                  >詳情 ›</a\r\n                >\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"row common_faq\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n            <h2><b>常見問題及例子示範</b></h2>\r\n            <div class=\"collapse_link\">\r\n              <a\r\n                href=\"example.html\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                aria-label=\" 有關「合資格新資金結餘」之計算方法及例子 [於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n              >\r\n                有關「合資格新資金結餘」之計算方法及例子</a\r\n              >\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"collapse_link\">\r\n              <a\r\n                href=\"step.html\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                aria-label=\"按此查閱以「合資格新資金結餘」經網上設立定期存款之示範[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                >按此查閱以「合資格新資金結餘」經網上設立定期存款之示範</a\r\n              >\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"collapse_header_wrapper\">\r\n              <button\r\n                class=\"collapse_btn\"\r\n                data-toggle=\"collapse\"\r\n                data-target=\"#collapseFive\"\r\n                aria-expanded=\"false\"\r\n                aria-controls=\"collapseFive\"\r\n              >\r\n                我可隨時透過網上銀行或電話理財設立定期存款並享新資金定期存款優惠嗎？\r\n                <div class=\"expand_arrow\"></div>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div id=\"collapseFive\" class=\"collapse\">\r\n              <div class=\"main_content_area\">\r\n                <div class=\"row\">\r\n                  <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px\">\r\n                      你可於以下交易時段內設立相關定期存款以獲享新資金定期存款優惠：\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px\">\r\n                      <u>恒生個人e-Banking及恒生Mobile App</u>\r\n                      <ul>\r\n                        <li>星期一至五上午8時至下午7時55分</li>\r\n                        <li>星期六上午8時至下午4時55分 （只適用於港元）</li>\r\n                      </ul>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px\">\r\n                      <u>恒生電話理財熱線</u>\r\n                      <ul>\r\n                        <li>星期一至五上午9時至下午7時</li>\r\n                        <li>星期六上午9時至下午12時55分</li>\r\n                      </ul>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    如於非交易時段、星期日、香港公眾假期、外匯貨幣之發行國家/地區當地假期或受惡劣天氣影響如颱風信號或暴雨警告所引致之非營業日設立定期存款，你將不可享有新資金特優年利率優惠。\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"collapse_header_wrapper\">\r\n              <button\r\n                class=\"collapse_btn\"\r\n                data-toggle=\"collapse\"\r\n                data-target=\"#collapseSix\"\r\n                aria-expanded=\"false\"\r\n                aria-controls=\"collapseSix\"\r\n              >\r\n                如何存入外幣新資金?\r\n                <div class=\"expand_arrow\"></div>\r\n              </button>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div id=\"collapseSix\" class=\"collapse\">\r\n              <div class=\"main_content_area\">\r\n                <div class=\"row\">\r\n                  <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px\">\r\n                      你可以透過<strong\r\n                        >匯款 (Remittance) 或匯票 (Demand Draft) </strong\r\n                      >把資金轉入本行。開始前請先準備以下資料：\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    <div style=\"margin-bottom: 10px\">\r\n                      <ul>\r\n                        <li>收款人的姓名、地址及銀行戶口號碼</li>\r\n                        <li>\r\n                          本行名稱：恒生銀行有限公司 / Hang Seng Bank Limited\r\n                        </li>\r\n                        <li>\r\n                          本行地址：香港德輔道中 83 號 / 83 Des Voeux Road\r\n                          Central, Hong Kong\r\n                        </li>\r\n                        <li>本行銀行代號： 024</li>\r\n                        <li>本行 SWIFT 代碼：HASEHKHH</li>\r\n                        <li>本行 CHIPS 代號 (用於由美國匯出匯款)：010522</li>\r\n                      </ul>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                    個別銀行所需資料或有所出入，如有查詢，請聯絡客戶服務熱線。請留意，有關服務或需收取手續費，詳情請參考本行最新的服務費用簡介及向相關支賬銀行查詢。\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <!-- <div class=\"floating-btn\">\r\n          <div class=\"row\" style=\"padding-top: 0\">\r\n            <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n              <div class=\"floating-flex\">\r\n                <p class=\"h3 text-center\" style=\"margin-top: 0\">\r\n                  <b>精選優惠 </b><br />存入新資金達存款增長\r\n                  尊享港元定存年利率高達<strong>5%</strong>\r\n                </p>\r\n                <div>\r\n                  <div class=\"mc1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"btn2\">\r\n                      <a\r\n                        class=\"view_d2g\"\r\n                        href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/zh-hk/online/account/time-deposits/set-up-fixed-deposit/\"\r\n                        target=\"_blank\"\r\n                        aria-label=\"經網上設立定期存款[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                        id=\"setup_new_fund_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"TMS.trackEvent('link',{event_value:'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_setup-new-fund',event_category:'content',event_action:'button'})\"\r\n                        >經網上設立定期存款</a\r\n                      >\r\n                      <a\r\n                        class=\"view_daasc\"\r\n                        href=\"haserbapp://open/?key=p2g_time_deposits\"\r\n                        target=\"_blank\"\r\n                        aria-label=\"經網上設立定期存款[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                        id=\"setup_new_fund_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"TMS.trackEvent('link',{event_value:'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_setup-new-fund',event_category:'content',event_action:'button'})\"\r\n                        >經網上設立定期存款\r\n                      </a>\r\n                      <a\r\n                        class=\"view_link\"\r\n                        href=\"https://cms.hangseng.com/cms/emkt/pmo/grp02/p30/chi/index.html\"\r\n                        >了解詳情\r\n                      </a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                  <div class=\"m1\">\r\n                    <div class=\"btn2\">\r\n                      <a\r\n                        class=\"view_d2g view_daasc\"\r\n                        href=\"haserbapp://open/?key=p2g_time_deposits\"\r\n                        target=\"_blank\"\r\n                        aria-label=\"經網上設立定期存款[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                        id=\"setup_new_fund_btn\"\r\n                        onclick=\"TMS.trackEvent('link',{event_value:'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_setup-new-fund',event_category:'content',event_action:'button'})\"\r\n                        >經網上設立定期存款\r\n                      </a>\r\n                      <a\r\n                        class=\"view_link\"\r\n                        href=\"https://cms.hangseng.com/cms/emkt/pmo/grp02/p30/chi/index.html\"\r\n                        >了解詳情\r\n                      </a>\r\n                    </div>\r\n                  </div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div> -->\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div id=\"mymodal\" class=\"modal1\">\r\n        <div class=\"modal-content1\">\r\n          <span class=\"close1\">x</span><br />\r\n          <br />\r\n          <div class=\"popapp\">\r\n            <img src=\"images/appicon2.png\" alt=\"恒生個人流動理財服務應用程式\" />\r\n          </div>\r\n          <br />\r\n          <h2><b>恒生個人流動理財服務應用程式</b></h2>\r\n          <div style=\"display: inline-block\">\r\n            <a\r\n              class=\"btn_n_custom4\"\r\n              href=\"haserbapp://open/?key=p2g_time_deposits\"\r\n              >了解詳情\r\n            </a>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <div style=\"display: inline-block\">\r\n            <div class=\"view_android\">\r\n              <a\r\n                class=\"btn_n_custom4 download btn-open-android\"\r\n                href=\"javascript:void(0);\"\r\n                >下載應用程式\r\n              </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"view_ios\">\r\n              <a\r\n                class=\"btn_n_custom4 download btn-download\"\r\n                href=\"javascript:void(0);\"\r\n                >下載應用程式\r\n              </a>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n          <br />\r\n          <br />\r\n          <div class=\"popapp\">\r\n            <img src=\"images/cicon.png\" alt=\"恒生個人流動理財服務應用程式\" />\r\n          </div>\r\n          <a\r\n            class=\"btn_n_custom4\"\r\n            href=\"https://cms.hangseng.com/cms/emkt/pmo/grp02/p30/chi/index.html\"\r\n            target=\"_blank\"\r\n            aria-label=\"登入恒生個人e-Banking[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n            >登入恒生個人e-Banking</a\r\n          >\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <div id=\"footer\">\r\n        <div class=\"footer_bot_area row text-justify\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n            <p><strong>備註：</strong></p>\r\n            <ol style=\"margin-bottom: 20px\">\r\n              <li>\r\n                恒生個人e-Banking及恒生Mobile\r\n                App的交易時段為星期一至五上午8時至下午7時55分及星期六上午8時至下午4時55分\r\n                （只適用於港元）。如於非交易時段、星期日、香港公眾假期、外匯貨幣之發行國家/地區當地假期或受惡劣天氣影響如颱風信號或暴雨警告所引致之非營業日透過網上途徑設立定期存款，客戶將不可享有新資金特優年利率優惠。客戶如欲獲享新資金定期存款優惠，請於交易時段內開立相關定期存款。\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li style=\"text-justify: auto\">\r\n                <div class=\"view_d2g\">\r\n                  恒生電話理財熱線的交易時段為星期一至五上午9時至下午7時及星期六上午9時至下午12時55分；星期日、香港公眾假期及外匯貨幣當地假期休息。有關重設電話理財密碼詳情，請<a\r\n                    href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/zh-hk/personal/banking-services/phone-banking/how-to-reset-pin/\"\r\n                    >按此</a\r\n                  >。\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"view_p2g\">\r\n                  恒生電話理財熱線的交易時段為星期一至五上午9時至下午7時及星期六上午9時至下午12時55分；星期日、香港公眾假期及外匯貨幣當地假期休息。有關重設電話理財密碼詳情，請瀏覽恒生銀行網頁\r\n                  > 銀行服務 > 分行、自助銀行及電話銀行 > 電話銀行 >\r\n                  如何重設密碼參考。\r\n                </div>\r\n                <div class=\"view_daasc\">\r\n                  恒生電話理財熱線的交易時段為星期一至五上午9時至下午7時及星期六上午9時至下午12時55分；星期日、香港公眾假期及外匯貨幣當地假期休息。有關重設電話理財密碼詳情，請瀏覽hangseng.com\r\n                  （個人理財 &gt; 銀行服務 &gt; 電話銀行 &gt; 如何重設密碼)\r\n                  參考。\r\n                </div>\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                「合資格新資金結餘」是指客戶之最新存款總結餘與15曆日前之同一貨幣結餘對比所增加之金額，扣減15曆日內\r\n                (包含今天)\r\n                已享用新資金優惠之定期存款本金總額。所有由客戶持有的單名及/或聯名儲蓄、往來及定期賬戶\r\n                (包括港元及外幣)\r\n                之結餘均會被計算在內。如對「合資格新資金結餘」的定義有任何爭議，本行保留最終決定權。\r\n              </li>\r\n              <li>\r\n                此優惠只適用於兌換指定貨幣達指定交易金額，並同時設立一星期/一個月定期存款。外幣兌換涉及匯率風險，優惠附帶條款。詳情請瀏覽hangseng.com/forexoffer。\r\n              </li>\r\n            </ol>\r\n\r\n            <p><strong>計算年利息的每年日數依據如下：</strong></p>\r\n            <ul style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; margin-left: 0\">\r\n              <li>港元 - 365天(非閏年)或366天(閏年)；</li>\r\n              <li>英鎊、泰國銖及南非蘭特 - 365天；</li>\r\n              <li>其他貨幣 - 360天。</li>\r\n            </ul>\r\n            <!-- \r\n            <p class=\"view_daasc\" style=\"line-height: 14px; text-align: left\">\r\n              轉數快為香港銀行同業結算有限公司所提供之快速支付系統服務，而「存錢快」乃基於快速支付系統（轉數快）之技術所運作。服務附帶條款。查閱銀行服務快速支付系統（轉數快）之條款及細則請参考<a\r\n                href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/content/dam/hase/zh_hk/personal/banking-services/pdf/account_rules.pdf\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                aria-label=\"按此查閱以「合資格新資金結餘」經網上設立定期存款之示範[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                class=\"exlink\"\r\n                style=\"font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px\"\r\n                ><span>戶口章則</span></a\r\n              >的第IX部份或<a\r\n                href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/content/dam/hase/zh_hk/personal/banking-services/pdf/ia_tnc_chi.pdf\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                aria-label=\"按此查閱以「合資格新資金結餘」經網上設立定期存款之示範[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                class=\"exlink\"\r\n                style=\"font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px\"\r\n                >綜合戶口章則</a\r\n              >的第XIV部份。\r\n            </p>\r\n            <p class=\"view_d2g\" style=\"line-height: 14px; text-align: left\">\r\n              轉數快為香港銀行同業結算有限公司所提供之快速支付系統服務，而「存錢快」乃基於快速支付系統（轉數快）之技術所運作。服務附帶條款。查閱銀行服務快速支付系統（轉數快）之條款及細則請参考<a\r\n                href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/content/dam/hase/zh_hk/personal/banking-services/pdf/account_rules.pdf\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                aria-label=\"按此查閱以「合資格新資金結餘」經網上設立定期存款之示範[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                class=\"exlink\"\r\n                style=\"font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px\"\r\n                ><span>戶口章則</span></a\r\n              >的第IX部份或<a\r\n                href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/content/dam/hase/zh_hk/personal/banking-services/pdf/ia_tnc_chi.pdf\"\r\n                target=\"_blank\"\r\n                aria-label=\"按此查閱以「合資格新資金結餘」經網上設立定期存款之示範[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n                class=\"exlink\"\r\n                style=\"font-size: 11px; line-height: 14px\"\r\n                >綜合戶口章則</a\r\n              >的第XIV部份。\r\n            </p>\r\n\r\n            <p class=\"view_p2g\" style=\"line-height: 14px; text-align: left\">\r\n              轉數快為香港銀行同業結算有限公司所提供之快速支付系統服務，而「存錢快」乃基於快速支付系統（轉數快）之技術所運作。服務附帶條款。查閱銀行服務快速支付系統（轉數快）之條款及細則請參考戶口章則 (瀏覽恒生銀行網頁 > 銀行服務 > 銀行服務概覽 >  其他銀行服務 > 有用資料 > 條款及細則- 非綜合戶口章則) 的第IX部份或綜合戶口章則 (瀏覽恒生銀行網頁 > 銀行服務 > 銀行服務概覽 > 其他銀行服務 > 有用資料 > 條款及細則- 綜合戶口章則) 的第XIV部份。\r\n            </p> -->\r\n\r\n            <div class=\"border-box columns\">\r\n              <div class=\"large-12 columns text-justify\">\r\n                <br />\r\n                <p>\r\n                  <strong\r\n                    ><u>人民幣貨幣風險</u><br />\r\n                    人民幣乃受制於匯率風險。客戶於兌換人民幣至其他貨幣(包括港幣)時將可能受匯率波動而引致損失。有關當局所實施的外匯管制亦可能對適用匯率造成不利的影響。人民幣現時並非自由兌換的貨幣，可能受制於若干政策、監管要求及/或限制(有關政策、監管要求或限制將不時更改而毋須另行通知)。實際的兌換安排須依據當時的政策、監管要求及/或限制而定。</strong\r\n                  >\r\n                </p>\r\n                <p>\r\n                  <strong\r\n                    ><u>外幣兌換風險</u><br />\r\n                    外幣兌換涉及匯率風險。客戶如將存款由港幣或外幣兌換為其他貨幣時，外匯波動可能導致本金產生利潤或蒙受虧損。如需在外幣定期到期後將外幣兌換回其他貨幣（包括港幣），存款額可能因當時外幣匯率之變動而出現利潤或蒙受虧損。</strong\r\n                  >\r\n                </p>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n        <div class=\"footer_state_area row\">\r\n          <div class=\"large-12 columns\">\r\n            <div class=\"copy\">\r\n              <!-- MUST INCLUDE START -->\r\n              <script language=\"JavaScript\">\r\n                // <!--\r\n                createStatement();\r\n                //-->\r\n              </script>\r\n              <!-- MUST INCLUDE END -->\r\n            </div>\r\n            <div class=\"member\">\r\n              <!-- MUST INCLUDE START -->\r\n              <script language=\"JavaScript\">\r\n                // <!--\r\n                createHsbcLogo();\r\n                //-->\r\n              </script>\r\n              <!-- MUST INCLUDE END -->\r\n            </div>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </div>\r\n      <!--warp-->\r\n    </div>\r\n    <!---->\r\n    <!-- Floating Banner -->\r\n    <div id=\"sticky-bottom-overlay\" class=\"view_daasc view_d2g\">\r\n      <div class=\"sticky-content-top\">\r\n        \r\n      </div>\r\n      <div class=\"sticky-btns\" style=\"flex-direction: row; margin-top: 8px\">\r\n        \r\n        <a\r\n          class=\"view_d2g button-action orange-btn\"\r\n          href=\"https://www.hangseng.com/zh-hk/online/account/time-deposits/set-up-fixed-deposit/\"\r\n          target=\"_blank\"\r\n          aria-label=\"經網上設立定期存款[於新視窗開啟]\"\r\n          id=\"dbg_fx_btn_tc_exchangeonline\"\r\n          onclick=\"\r\n            TMS.trackEvent('link', {\r\n              event_value: 'zh-hk_grp06-p04_FX_PromoPage_setup-new-f