ank\">新加坡網頁</a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"https://www.hkbea.co.uk/\" target=\"_blank\">英國網頁</a></li><li><a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"/html/tc/bea-international-services-strategic-partners.html\" target=\"_self\">策略聯盟伙伴</a></li></ul></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><div xmlns:file=\"http://expath.org/ns/file\" class=\"overlayMask\"></div><!--</HKBEAHEADER>-->\n   <main class=\"content-grid\">\n      \n      <div class=\"page-head\">\n         <script src=\"/js_common_breadcrumb/breadcrumb_tc.js\"></script>\r\n<div id=\"sys_breadcrumbDiv\"></div>\r\n\r\n<!--SystemComponentDataStart:pageSetting-->\n         <!--SystemComponentDataEnd:pageSetting--><!--SystemComponentDataStart:pageSeo-->\n         <!--SystemComponentDataEnd:pageSeo--><!--SystemComponentDataStart:pagePromoptionBar-->\n         <!--SystemComponentDataEnd:pagePromoptionBar--><!--SystemComponentDataStart:pageTitle-->\n         <h1 class=\"page-title\">特惠定期存款利率</h1><!--SystemComponentDataEnd:pageTitle--></div>\n      <!--SystemComponentDataStart:pageMenu--><div class=\"page-menu-container\">\n  <div class=\"page-menu-swiper swiper\">\n    <div class=\"swiper-wrapper\" id=\"sys_pageMenuDiv\">\n\t\t\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"swiper-controls\">\n      <div class=\"swiper-button-prev\"></div>\n      <div class=\"swiper-button-next\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"swiper-pagination\"></div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<!--SystemComponentDataEnd:pageMenu--><!--SystemComponentDataStart:Component1--><!--<COMPONENT START>--><div data-component-type=\"freeContent\"><!--COMPONENT compScriptBefore--><!--COMPONENT Top Line-->\n   <hr>\n   <!--COMPONENT Section Title-->\n   <div class=\"section-subtitle\">\n      <h2>特惠定期存款利率</h2>\n   </div>\n   <!--COMPONENT Content-->\n   <div class=\"basic-style\">\n      <div><div>\n<p><img src=\"/images/tc/latest-promo/sg_time_deposit_537x290.jpg\" alt=\"特惠定期存款利率\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 537px;\" /></p>\n<p>透過東亞網上銀行及東亞手機銀行，於服務時間內以指定金額的「合資格新資金結餘」或現有資金新設立定期存款，可根據定期存款戶口類別享有特惠年利率。</p>\n<hr style=\"margin-block: 0.5em;\" />\n<p style=\"color: #a6192e;\">「合資格新資金結餘」是指客戶之最新存款總結餘(包括儲蓄、往來及定期賬戶)，與15曆日前之同一貨幣結餘對比所增加之金額，扣減15曆日內已享用同一貨幣新資金優惠之定期存款本金總額及東亞「密密增」活期存款本金總額。</p>\n<hr style=\"margin-block: 0.5em;\" />\n<p>以下特惠年利率只適用於新開立之定期存款，並不適用於續存之定期存款。</p>\n<hr style=\"margin-block: 0.5em;\" />\n<p><strong>網上港元定期存款特惠年利率 (%)</strong></p>\n<table class=\"generic-table vertical-align-middle\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 134px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\" rowspan=\"3\">存款期</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\">顯卓私人理財<br />或<br />顯卓理財</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\">至尊理財</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\">BEA GOAL<br />或<br />其他個人綜合戶口</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"2\">(原幣10,000或以上)</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">(原幣1,000或以上)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%;\" colspan=\"3\">新資金／現有資金*</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3個月</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.65 / 2.55</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.60 / 2.55</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.60 / 2.55</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">6個月</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.65 / 2.55</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.60 / 2.55</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.60 / 2.55</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">12個月</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.65 / 2.55</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.60 / 2.55</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">2.60 / 2.55</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><strong>網上美元定期存款特惠年利率(%)</strong></p>\n<table class=\"generic-table vertical-align-middle\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 153px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 96px;\" rowspan=\"3\">存款期</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\">顯卓私人理財<br />或<br />顯卓理財</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\">至尊理財</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 58px;\">BEA GOAL<br />或<br />其他個人綜合戶口</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"3\">(原幣1,000或以上)</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 19px;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\" colspan=\"3\">新資金／現有資金*</th>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3個月</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.60 / 3.50</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.55 / 3.50</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.55 / 3.50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">6個月</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.60 / 3.50</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.55 / 3.50</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.55 / 3.50</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">12個月</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.60 / 3.50</td>\n<td style=\"padding: 10px; width: 24.9664%; height: 19px;\">3.55 / 3.50</td>\n<td style=\"padd